  "notes": "One TARGET slot read by both steps (Sure Strike's form), printed order: trample grant, then +X/+X with X = QProp('source', POWER), locked as the trigger resolves (MODIFY_PT records the number). Packs: tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/ashroot_animist_shares_its_power_and_trample.json, tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/ashroot_animist_bonus_ends_with_the_turn.json."
